+---
+'@flamboyantengineer/ui-components': minor
+---
+
+Add public formatting glyphs for fonts, number formats, cell alignment, table borders, wrapping, merging and cutting. All marks follow the shared outline and provider override contracts and appear in the icon lab at each supported size.
